    "reason": "Accepted main's RTL and arrow growth after merging main into the charts branch, captured twice from a clean tree with identical measurements. main's own size check passes. Four rows fail here only against the stricter baseline the chart branch captured in November: React Tooltip 19,414 B to 21,566 B, Vue Tooltip 20,216 B to 22,312 B, Runtime root 133,734 B to 138,287 B and init-starwind 132,386 B to 136,884 B. The Runtime catalog row measures the same root bundle as the Runtime root row, so it moves to 138,287 B with it. Only those five rows were updated. The chart rows changed by 2 B or less and stay as accepted. On 2026-11-22 the chart contract alignment moved chart visibility into the Runtime controller and added a shared tooltip layout helper. init-starwind moved from 136,884 B to 136,893 B (+9 B). The chart rows grew within their thresholds and stay as accepted. On 2026-11-22 the stable fix lanes changed Runtime pointer-press, Tab dismissal, Menu radio ARIA and Navigation Menu default handling. A clean rebuild measured Runtime root and the Runtime catalog at 138,312 B (+25 B) and init-starwind at 136,909 B (+16 B). Only those three rows were updated."
